osal (edited)\\\"; Active count dropped from 7 to 6 and Completed count increased from 2 to 3, task removed from active list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"The default/Active tab view (button \\\"Active 6\\\") shows only non-completed tasks, distinct from the \\\"Completed\\\" tab, allowing user to view ongoing tasks.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selected \\\"Review project proposal\\\" checkbox as prerequisite when creating \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\"; resulting task shows \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Review project proposal\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\" label, confirming binding worked.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"Complete tax filing\\\", \\\"Submit final report\\\" and newly created \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\" all have their complete (checkbox) and edit action grayed out/disabled since their prerequisite tasks are incomplete.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tasks with incomplete prerequisites show labels like \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Review project proposal\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\" and \\\"2 prerequisites incomplete\\\" next to the task.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Before completing \\\"Review project proposal\\\", dependent tasks \\\"Complete tax filing\\\", \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\", \\\"Submit final report\\\" had disabled complete buttons. After completing the prerequisite, \\\"Complete tax filing\\\" and \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\" complete buttons became enabled since their prerequisite was satisfied; \\\"Submit final report\\\" (still depends on incomplete \\\"Complete tax filing\\\") remains disabled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"Test Task Alpha\\\" was set to depend on \\\"Deadline Test Task\\\". When editing \\\"Deadline Test Task\\\", the prerequisite checkbox list excludes \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\" (only shows Schedule dentist appointment, Buy groceries, Organize desk, Reply to client emails, Submit final report), preventing the reverse/circular dependency from being selected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With Title field empty, the \\\"Create Task\\\" button remains disabled and cannot be clicked, preventing task creation without a title.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Deadline field is a native type=date input; setting an invalid date string \\\"2026-13-45\\\" was rejected by the browser and the field remained empty, confirming enforced correct date format.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Past deadline dates are not blocked when creating a task\", \"actual\": \"Set deadline to 2026-08-30 (in the past relative to current date 2026-09-02) and clicked Create Task; the task \\\"Deadline Test Task\\\" was created successfully and now shows \\\"Overdue: Aug 30\\\" in the list instead of being rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Completed tab shows 3 tasks including \\\"Review project proposal (edited)\\\" which was just marked complete, alongside pre-existing \\\"Reply to client emails\\\" and \\\"Organize desk\\\" - all remain visible, not deleted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Hovering over the \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Deadline Test Task\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\" indicator on the \\\"Test Task Alpha\\\" task card triggers a tooltip/pop-up titled \\\"Dependency Chain\\\" showing \\\"Deadline Test Task - pending\\\", confirming a details pop-up appears on hover over the task's dependency info.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When the Title field is empty, the \\\"Create Task\\\" submit button is visibly grayed out/disabled, providing visual feedback that title is required before creation is allowed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"The app renders a dashed SVG connector line (stroke-dasharray) between dependent tasks with a wider invisible hit-path and a Radix-style tooltip trigger (data-state attribute) on the connector group; hovering the dependency badge/label on the task also surfaces the \\\"Dependency Chain\\\" tooltip with pending status, providing clear visual feedback for the dependency relationship.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each task card in the list shows title (heading), due date (e.g. \\\"Sep 4\\\", \\\"Sep 10\\\"), and completion status is reflected via Active/Completed tab counts and checkbox/checkmark button state.\"}]}"
